  (text "Battery current: CUR = 0.1 V/A on J1 pin 3 (FC ADC PA4); discharge only.\nMotor peak about 8 A -> 0.8 V; full scale 31 A at 3.1 V.\nShunt loss at 6 A: 72 mW. U1 senses R9 through two Kelvin tracks."
    (at 15.24 72.39 0)
    (effects
      (font
