  (text "Common 4-in-1 ESC pinout. A brushless 20 x 20 1S 4-in-1 ESC plugs into the\nsame FC cable: check its pinout first (some vendors swap VBAT/GND or CUR/TLM).\nTLM (pin 4) is not used by this brushed board.\nVBAT on pin 2 also supplies the whole FC (up to 0.5 A at 4.1 V).\nVBAT is off while the charge port is plugged in (Q5): FC and motors off."
    (at 190.5 30.48 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "0b485709-60d0-5b0f-b123-d8d7e9ac3af1"))
